
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>My First Website</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      text-align: center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #141e30, #243b55);
      color: white;
      padding: 40px 15px;
    }
    .card {
      max-width: 500px;
      margin: 30px auto;
      padding: 30px 20px;
      background: #ffffff18;
      border-radius: 20px;
    }
    h1 { color: #ffd166; }
    button {
      padding: 12px 22px;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: #ffd166;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 16px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <h1>Welcome to My Website!</h1>
    <p>Hello! I am learning to create websites.</p>
    <p>This is my first project using GitHub.</p>
    <button onclick="alert('Thanks for visiting!')">
      Click Me
    </button>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
